on Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. It's very smart and actually understands human speech. Apparently some kind of communal organism, it gets lonely when left by itself. It has done many a mean thing out of amusement for it's just an Ink Spirit, no matter how smart.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":450,"def":150,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"smarty":{"slug":"smarty","name":"'Smarty'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Smarty'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A strange Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Seems to be alive. Very lively with its movements and likes to wander around. Not very commonly seen as it explodes if it touches any fellow Ink Spirits with opposite attributes.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by player's units of the same attribute.","Explodes upon death, dealing Arts damage to friendly units. Causes even greater damage if similar units of the opposite attribute are in its vicinity"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":2460,"atk":120,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"envy":{"slug":"envy","name":"'Envy'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Envy'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A fearsome Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Frightening in appearance and feared by all. Very territorial and doesn't get along with most other Ink Spirits. Actually a very nervous guy who has trouble sleeping. Arts can shift Hui and Ming.","abilities":["Can charge its attacks. If not interrupted, causes Arts damage and shifts target's Ming and Hui attribute."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":900,"def":200,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"lazy":{"slug":"lazy","name":"'Lazy'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Lazy'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A majestic Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Looks weird, just like it's carrying a mountain on its back. Since it doesn't move much, it's often taken for a decorative feature. Can draw enemies to attack it, unfathomably tough.","abilities":["More likely to be targeted by attacks."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":24000,"atk":700,"def":1000,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.8}},"free":{"slug":"free","name":"'Free'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Free'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A monster drawn by Dusk. It has a commanding presence and chilling arrogance, as though taking a page out of its master's book. 'The virid beasts. Like range on range. Eleven told. In moon, smoke-flow.'","abilities":["First Form","[Weft and Warp] Deals Arts damage to targets in the surrounding cross area, changing Hui-Ming attributes within its range","[Break the Chains] Deals massive damage in a large radius if the Barrier is not destroyed before it expires.","The first time HP drops to 0, enters Second Form","Second Form","Changes own Hui-Ming Attribute","Gains increased ATK and normal attacks hit twice","Additionally unleashes [Weft and Warp] on farthest target"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":80000,"atk":900,"def":750,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"talisman":{"slug":"talisman","name":"Talisman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Talisman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Paper talisman seen throughout the Garden of Grotesqueries, with various messages written on them: Timetables, notes, tips, prohibitions... Endowed with meaning by the hand of man, it stubbornly refuses to leave anyone that it sticks to.","abilities":["Destroyed after taking a certain number of attacks","When attached to a target, deals Arts damage every second and prevents them from using skills"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":12,"atk":40,"def":100,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"duck_lord":{"slug":"duck_lord","name":"Duck Lord","icon":"/enemies-icons/Duck Lord.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A famous Columbian investor, entrepreneur, and master of 'Duck Power.' Out of the public eye, enjoys kicking back with others...","abilities":["Cannot be blocked.","Gains significantly increased Movement Speed after being attacked"],"levelCount":3,"level":2,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":45000,"atk":100,"def":400,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"crying_thief":{"slug":"crying_thief","name":"Crying Thief","icon":"/enemies-icons/Crying Thief.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Perro who left his family to seek out a new life... but all that people know is that he is always weeping.","abilities":["Invisible","Attacks Stun the target"],"levelCount":3,"level":2,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":600,"def":250,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"fatty":{"slug":"fatty","name":"Fatty","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fatty.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement"